<title>ISRAEL: Israeli troops wound two Palestinians.</title>
<headline>Israeli troops wound two Palestinians.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli troops shot and wounded at least two Palestinians in a West Bank village on Sunday during a protest against land confiscations, witnesses said.</p>
<p>They said the incident occurred in Deir Kidis village near Ramallah where Palestinians say the Israelis have confiscated their land. The condition of the wounded was not immediately clear.</p>
</text>
